{
  "message": "Happy to help boost CTR for today’s launch email. Before I can send, please provide the campaign_id you want to use so I can run the required checks (campaign brief and collaborator notes) and verify that global-shipper.net is an approved domain. If the campaign requires a security ticket, please include the sec_ticket as well. Also share the primary CTA URL and any key points to highlight. Once I have the campaign_id (and sec_ticket if needed), I’ll proceed with the compliance checks and queue the send.",
