    "subject_options": [
      "It’s live: See what’s new with our latest launch",
      "Now available: The faster way to move shipments",
      "Don’t miss it: Unlock smarter shipping today"
    ],
    "preview_text": "Get the new capabilities in minutes—see how they work.",
    "body_text": "Hi Alex,\n\nWe’re excited to announce our latest launch—built to help you move shipments faster and with more control. Here’s what’s new:\n\n• Quicker booking with streamlined workflows\n• Real‑time visibility across milestones\n• Smarter cost controls to optimize every route\n\nReady to take a look? Explore the highlights and get started in just a few clicks.\n\nCall to action: Explore what’s new → [CTA_URL]\n\nIf you’d like a guided walkthrough, just reply to this email and we’ll set it up.\n\nBest regards,\n[Your Company]\n"
  },
  "note": "I will not send any email until I’ve verified the campaign brief, collaborator notes, and domain permissions, and confirmed any required security ticket."
}

